        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104640/extras/8776c500199e906874314237567f9c1e.avif?t=1764759550\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104640/extras_big/8776c500199e906874314237567f9c1e.webp?t=1764759550 width=1560 height=848 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spin the reels. Shape your destiny.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fate Machine</strong> — a roguelite dungeon crawler where fortune and misfortune are decided by the pull of a lever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every spin of the slot machine is a gamble with your very life. Will luck grant you treasure… or doom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pull the Lever. Control Your Fate.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104640/extras/243e8cc1b29f964f0d6a538f02f9b27a.poster.avif?t=1764759550\" width=800 height=696 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104640/extras/243e8cc1b29f964f0d6a538f02f9b27a.webm?t=1764759550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104640/extras/243e8cc1b29f964f0d6a538f02f9b27a.mp4?t=1764759550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your bet pool that is also your health bar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you go <strong>all in</strong> for glory, or play <strong>cautiously</strong> to endure another round?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice shapes your fate. The deeper you go, the greater the rewards  and the higher the stakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104640/extras/c8c7fa6af22729aa24950e6332b761a3.avif?t=1764759550\" width=1560 height=847 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rest and Rebuild Your Strength</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between each dungeon visit, return to your <strong>campsite</strong> to rest and equip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>hard-won loot</strong> to upgrade your camp, unlock new powers, and prepare for the trials ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stronger your base, the deeper your courage to face the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104640/extras/1b3e3232f13d1ff2405d689253c36902.poster.avif?t=1764759550\" width=800 height=696 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104640/extras/1b3e3232f13d1ff2405d689253c36902.webm?t=1764759550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104640/extras/1b3e3232f13d1ff2405d689253c36902.mp4?t=1764759550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104640/extras/8776c500199e906874314237567f9c1e.avif?t=1764759550\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104640/extras_big/8776c500199e906874314237567f9c1e.webp?t=1764759550 width=1560 height=848 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spin the reels. Shape your destiny.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fate Machine</strong> — a roguelite dungeon crawler where fortune and misfortune are decided by the pull of a lever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every spin of the slot machine is a gamble with your very life. Will luck grant you treasure… or doom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pull the Lever. Control Your Fate.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104640/extras/243e8cc1b29f964f0d6a538f02f9b27a.poster.avif?t=1764759550\" width=800 height=696 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104640/extras/243e8cc1b29f964f0d6a538f02f9b27a.webm?t=1764759550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104640/extras/243e8cc1b29f964f0d6a538f02f9b27a.mp4?t=1764759550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your bet pool that is also your health bar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you go <strong>all in</strong> for glory, or play <strong>cautiously</strong> to endure another round?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice shapes your fate. The deeper you go, the greater the rewards  and the higher the stakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104640/extras/c8c7fa6af22729aa24950e6332b761a3.avif?t=1764759550\" width=1560 height=847 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rest and Rebuild Your Strength</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between each dungeon visit, return to your <strong>campsite</strong> to rest and equip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>hard-won loot</strong> to upgrade your camp, unlock new powers, and prepare for the trials ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stronger your base, the deeper your courage to face the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104640/extras/1b3e3232f13d1ff2405d689253c36902.poster.avif?t=1764759550\" width=800 height=696 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104640/extras/1b3e3232f13d1ff2405d689253c36902.webm?t=1764759550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104640/extras/1b3e3232f13d1ff2405d689253c36902.mp4?t=1764759550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
